Q: How to hide title bar from my current window titanium Android A: <p>Change Your Photo.js file like this</p>

<pre><code>var win = Titanium.UI.currentWindow;

var imageView = Titanium.UI.createImageView({
    height: 200,
    width: 200,
    top: 20,
    left: 10,
    navBarHidden: true,
    backgroundColor: '#999',
});

win.add(imageView);
</code></pre>

<p>This will work</p>
